  "id": "social-agency",
  "term": "social agency",
  "definition": "Social agency is the quality of an intelligent system that leads people to see it as a social, human-like partner rather than just a tool. In the source, this feature is described as something that can shape a person’s mental model of the machine and affect trust in human–robot teamwork.",
